	(text "Across DC+/DC- at the module pins (CRD UG Fig. 22 / 19 networks). Spread over both legs in layout;\nresistors: pulse-rated wide-terminal 2512 with a thermal path to the plane (dab_spec 1.21 W worst)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 456.344 181.468 0)
